{"id": "sdqa0123", "pool": "sdqa", "arm": "conservative", "tier": "conservative", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2349223084, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "090c2d92c356947a63016f36b07b41f7e50a5af6eb8978ebb4bd17bc3458e59b", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.9057239890098572, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 3, "query": "When did the British Empire end?", "input_path": "/data/sdqa_audio/sdqa0123.wav", "input_sha256": "8e235060d23aeab3018c6e6f3a48821e01a75ec96945dde8d1b991cc863c6dde", "input_samples": 47098, "input_s": 2.944, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.3645, "act": 0.9988, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "The British Empire didn' t end all at once. It started to fade away during the 20th century, especially after World War II. Many countries that were under British rule gained independence in the late 1 94 0s and 1 95 0s. By the time the 1 980s came around, most of its major territories had already become independent. So while there are still some places like the UK itself or small islands with ties to Britain, the big empire as it was mostly ended by the mid- 2 0th century.", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 31, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/sdqa/audio/sdqa0123_conservative_local.wav", "sha256": "e6ad2fabc7c0cd80b0d201414e26ab710dd0a35bb9726cd885f37267ac3dc46d", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 30.52}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.063, 1.115, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.068, 2.123, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 2.944, 3.011, 3.066, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.944, 4.016, 4.575, 0, 24000, 0], [4, 0, 4.944, 5.01, 5.743, 0, 24